{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of the Nekomancer! To harness the power of Nekomancy, you'll have to draw glyphs on your screen. Draw a 'Portal'  to seamlessly flip between the realms of the living and the dead! Every room of the tower has two layouts, one for each realm! You'll need to master the art of swapping between life and death to traverse the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/ab008e6d280dbdbfc65941a59112dacf.poster.avif?t=1762538468\" width=1154 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/ab008e6d280dbdbfc65941a59112dacf.webm?t=1762538468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/ab008e6d280dbdbfc65941a59112dacf.mp4?t=1762538468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Nekomancer, you have access to spells of resurrection. To cast a resurrection spell, you'll need to tag a ghost with the swipe of a magic-infused paw. Ghosts of different animal species require different glyphs to cast the resurrection spell. You must resurrect all the ghosts in both realms to clear a path forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/e2c80a845ceceaebcb09854719f5a785.poster.avif?t=1762538468\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/e2c80a845ceceaebcb09854719f5a785.webm?t=1762538468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/e2c80a845ceceaebcb09854719f5a785.mp4?t=1762538468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Tombstone Tower, an isometric grave haunted by ghosts and filled with mysteries...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your computer mouse as a magic wand &amp; draw all sorts of spells to influence rooms and resurrect ghosts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw portals to seamlessly swap room layouts between the realms of life and death!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the tower's 9 floors, battle ghosts, talk to travelers, and unravel the dark mystery of Tombstone Tower!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Nekomancer's goal is to free the ghosts of Tombstone Tower from their frightful slumber. On your journey up the spire, you'll encounter many an adventurer with their own personal story and goals. Learn the deeper lives of these adventurers as you ascend this tower of death, and understand what motivates them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spellcasting skillset will allow you to explore Tombstone Tower, resurrect ghosts, and meet many characters who have a unique relationship with death. What awaits at the end of the Nekomancer's death-defying journey to Tombstone Tower's precipice?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Vitality & Decay","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180290/d2be26a788c9a4c89b28f6833558d7d7ce12b196.jpg"},{"name":"Humor & Facade","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180290/fd8bd6a19024e5f45de5b5fbac2188783369f996.jpg"},{"name":"Forge & Fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180290/dedc478e79c2345c5ddf97f7c758cea832a9eac1.jpg"},{"name":"Silence & Amplify","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180290/26033068a2afe303edd77feeb914b511b7de2a03.jpg"},{"name":"Healing & Tragedy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180290/6b0ae48dd2cacaf5fdb42c5bb0f081e8bc23c2a4.jpg"},{"name":"Isolate & Congregate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180290/f51f2eb9190668f61bcb9a34c27edca04fd498ba.jpg"},{"name":"An Open Door","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180290/3f952189d7360631240e9fe1adc905e3afd03d33.jpg"},{"name":"No Longer Nowhere","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180290/4153c04f724ebd73d3ee71710370cb442a3679f2.jpg"},{"name":"Wings Against the Moon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180290/514595a2b5908e87426347f721b394aed4c251a2.jpg"},{"name":"A New Story to Tell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3180290/374216100305cf8c20ba9987e58d6abfc17737b5.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3180290?t=1762538468","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762538468","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/ea46966f96b2417adf52797ff5102b7290e4a206/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762538468","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/ea46966f96b2417adf52797ff5102b7290e4a206/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762538468","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of the Nekomancer! To harness the power of Nekomancy, you'll have to draw glyphs on your screen. Draw a 'Portal'  to seamlessly flip between the realms of the living and the dead! Every room of the tower has two layouts, one for each realm! You'll need to master the art of swapping between life and death to traverse the tower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/ab008e6d280dbdbfc65941a59112dacf.poster.avif?t=1762538468\" width=1154 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/ab008e6d280dbdbfc65941a59112dacf.webm?t=1762538468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/ab008e6d280dbdbfc65941a59112dacf.mp4?t=1762538468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Nekomancer, you have access to spells of resurrection. To cast a resurrection spell, you'll need to tag a ghost with the swipe of a magic-infused paw. Ghosts of different animal species require different glyphs to cast the resurrection spell. You must resurrect all the ghosts in both realms to clear a path forward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/e2c80a845ceceaebcb09854719f5a785.poster.avif?t=1762538468\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/e2c80a845ceceaebcb09854719f5a785.webm?t=1762538468\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/extras/e2c80a845ceceaebcb09854719f5a785.mp4?t=1762538468\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Tombstone Tower, an isometric grave haunted by ghosts and filled with mysteries...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your computer mouse as a magic wand &amp; draw all sorts of spells to influence rooms and resurrect ghosts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw portals to seamlessly swap room layouts between the realms of life and death!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the tower's 9 floors, battle ghosts, talk to travelers, and unravel the dark mystery of Tombstone Tower!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Nekomancer's goal is to free the ghosts of Tombstone Tower from their frightful slumber. On your journey up the spire, you'll encounter many an adventurer with their own personal story and goals. Learn the deeper lives of these adventurers as you ascend this tower of death, and understand what motivates them! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your spellcasting skillset will allow you to explore Tombstone Tower, resurrect ghosts, and meet many characters who have a unique relationship with death. What awaits at the end of the Nekomancer's death-defying journey to Tombstone Tower's precipice?</p>","developers":["Standing Cat"],"dlc":[4147360],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3180290/e1275b5e1f84484fe2db3563bdec3123f367a046/header.jpg?t=1762538468","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Sequoia 15.1<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i9<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB 